%% title: How a platform owner signs in
%% desc: The owner gives a password. On a known device the authenticator app code finishes the sign-in. On a new device the owner also types one code from an SMS and one from an email. A lost phone is covered by a recovery code in place of the app code.
flowchart LR
  P["Password"] --> K{"Known device?"}
  K -- yes --> A["Code from the<br/>authenticator app"]:::owner
  K -- no --> N["Code from SMS<br/>and code from email"]:::owner
  N --> A
  A --> S["Signed in"]
  A -. "phone lost" .-> R["Recovery code<br/>instead of the app code"]:::note
  R --> S
  classDef owner fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
